      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -504,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI contract review\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nContracts arrive by email or a shared Drive folder. The text is split into clauses, Claude extracts the key terms into a fixed schema, and a scoring step flags non-standard or high-risk language.\n\nHigh-risk contracts get a redline summary before routing. Every contract is routed to the right reviewer by type, logged in Airtable, and the requester gets a reply.\n\n**A lawyer reviews every contract.** The workflow does the first pass.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
